{"event_id": "evt_0014", "session": 1, "turn_no": 1, "world_time": "Sandbox e, night", "actor": "gm", "kind": "gm_narration", "summary": "Narration for amw8k67wgx2fvwd.", "visibility": "player", "knowledge_type": "fact", "known_to": [], "caused_by": [], "roll_ids": [], "tags": [], "details": {"text": "You haul the door shut. Inside, claws scrape on boards and the growl goes back into the dark among the shelves.\n\nYou set the tip of the blade to the seam at the latch. The steel strap goes white and runs and the first tack bites at once, a bead of glowing metal fusing strap to frame. You draw the tip up toward the top hinge. The first pass skates off the strap. The second scorches the wood and does not take. The third holds: the strap slumps into the frame and fuses.\n\nThrough the planks the dog paces and growls. It does not come at the door.\n\nTwo tacks, glowing orange in the lantern light. You signal Wick back and he retreats two steps, lantern high.\n\nWhat do you do?\n"}, "idempotency_key": "amw8k67wgx2fvwd:narr"}
