{"event_id": "evt_0023", "session": 1, "turn_no": 2, "world_time": "Sandbox e, night", "actor": "gm", "kind": "gm_narration", "summary": "Narration for amw8k8b5lcqwdpl.", "visibility": "player", "knowledge_type": "fact", "known_to": [], "caused_by": [], "roll_ids": [], "tags": [], "details": {"text": "\"It's shut. Stay behind me.\"\n\nYou set your shoulder to the planks at the latch and drive. The door shudders in its frame. The latch tack holds; up at the hinge strap the metal creaks and something gives a fraction.\n\nInside, the growling stops.\n\nThe door jumps against your shoulder, hit from the other side with the whole weight of the animal. The top tack tears out with a crack, the latch tack snaps, and the door slams outward. You stumble back a step as it swings past you.\n\nThe dog is in the broken doorway, an arm's length away, head low, favouring one leg. Wick is behind you; the lantern light swings across its eyes.\n\nYou are faster. What do you do?\n"}, "idempotency_key": "amw8k8b5lcqwdpl:narr"}
